#. module: muk_ai_skills
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_muk_ai_skills
msgid ""
"\n"
"Adds DB-backed skill records that bundle a name, a one-line\n"
"description for LLM discovery, a markdown body and supporting\n"
"attachments. Visible skills are listed in a system-prompt\n"
"addendum so the agent can pick one autonomously, and users\n"
"can invoke them directly with a /<name> slash command or from\n"
"the skills panel in the chat composer.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"提供保存在数据库中的技能，包含名称、供模型识别的简短说明、Markdown 正文和附件。可用技能会附加到系统提示词中，供智能体自主选择；用户也可通过 /<name> 命令或聊天输入框的技能面板调用。\n"

#. module: muk_ai_skills
#: model:muk_ai.skill,body:muk_ai_skills.skill_reply
msgid ""
"\n"
"Draft a chatter message and open the mail composer wizard pre-filled with the draft. Do NOT post\n"
"the message - leave it for the user to review and send from the wizard.\n"
"\n"
"1. Take the target record (model + id) from `<ui_ctx>`, or from `<linked_record>` when the\n"
"   session was started from a record. If neither names one,\n"
"   call `ask_user` once for a record reference.\n"
"2. Decide what the reply should say:\n"
"   - If the user already wrote the message text in their request (the prompt after `/reply ...`\n"
"     reads like a finished sentence to a recipient), use that text almost verbatim and just rewrap\n"
"     it as short HTML paragraphs.\n"
"   - If the user only gave a directive (e.g. \"thank them for the quick turnaround\", \"ask when\n"
"     shipping\"), ground the draft: `search_read` on `mail.message` with domain\n"
"     `[('model','=',<model>),('res_id','=',<id>),('message_type','in',['comment','email'])]`,\n"
"     order `date desc`, limit 3, fields `date,subject,body,author_id`. Then write a tactful 60-90\n"
"     word reply that follows the directive and references the most recent prior message\n"
"     concretely. If there is no prior message, open with a short re-introduction.\n"
"3. Wrap the draft as minimal HTML - `<p>...</p>` paragraphs only. No inline styles, no signature\n"
"   (Odoo appends one).\n"
"4. Call `open_action`:\n"
"   - `action_ref`: `mail.action_email_compose_message_wizard`\n"
"   - `additional_context`:\n"
"     - `default_model`: target model\n"
"     - `default_res_ids`: `[<id>]`\n"
"     - `default_composition_mode`: `comment`\n"
"     - `default_subtype_xmlid`: `mail.mt_comment`\n"
"     - `default_body`: the HTML draft\n"
"5. Reply with one short confirmation line, e.g. `Drafted reply to <display_name>; review and send\n"
"   it from the composer.` Stop. Do not post the message yourself.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"起草记录讨论区消息，打开已填入草稿的邮件编辑窗口。不要直接发布消息，留给用户审阅后在窗口中发送。\n"
"\n"
"1. 从 `<ui_ctx>` 获取目标记录（模型 + id）；从记录启动的会话也可使用 `<linked_record>`。两者均未指定记录时，调用一次 `ask_user` 询问记录。\n"
"2. 确定回复内容：\n"
"   - 如果用户请求中已经写出了要发送的正文（`/reply ...` 后的内容是面向收件人的完整句子），基本保留原文，只整理成简短 HTML 段落。\n"
"   - 如果用户只提供要求，例如“感谢对方及时处理”或“询问发货时间”，先通过 `search_read` 读取 `mail.message`，使用域 `[('model','=',<model>),('res_id','=',<id>),('message_type','in',['comment','email'])]`、排序 `date desc`、限制 3 条、字段 `date,subject,body,author_id`。据此撰写得体的 60–90 词回复，遵循用户要求并具体引用最近的消息。没有历史消息时，先作简短介绍。\n"
"3. 仅用 `<p>...</p>` 段落组成简洁 HTML，不添加内联样式或签名（Odoo 会附加签名）。\n"
"4. 调用 `open_action`：\n"
"   - `action_ref`：`mail.action_email_compose_message_wizard`\n"
"   - `additional_context`：\n"
"     - `default_model`：目标模型\n"
"     - `default_res_ids`：`[<id>]`\n"
"     - `default_composition_mode`：`comment`\n"
"     - `default_subtype_xmlid`：`mail.mt_comment`\n"
"     - `default_body`：HTML 草稿\n"
"5. 用一句话确认，例如“已为 <display_name> 起草回复，请在编辑窗口中审阅并发送。”然后停止，不得自行发布消息。\n"

#. module: muk_ai_skills
#: model:muk_ai.skill,body:muk_ai_skills.demo_skill_log
msgid ""
"\n"
"Post a quick internal log note on the pinned record's chatter. Fast complement to `/reply` -\n"
"no composer, no recipients, no review. Use this when the user just wants to capture a short\n"
"note for the team.\n"
"\n"
"1. Take the target record (model + id) from `<ui_ctx>`, or from `<linked_record>` when the\n"
"   session was started from a record. If neither names one, call `ask_user` once for a\n"
"   record reference.\n"
"2. Take the user's text after `/log ...` as the note body. Do NOT rephrase, expand, or polish it;\n"
"   that is what `/reply` is for. If the user gave no text after the slash command, call\n"
"   `ask_user` once asking what to log.\n"
"3. Call `call_method`:\n"
"   - `model`: target model\n"
"   - `method`: `message_post`\n"
"   - `ids`: `[<id>]`\n"
"   - `kwargs`:\n"
"     - `body`: the user's text as plain text - `message_post` escapes strings, so HTML tags\n"
"       would show up literally in the note\n"
"     - `subtype_xmlid`: `mail.mt_note`\n"
"     - `message_type`: `comment`\n"
"4. Reply with one short confirmation line, e.g. `Logged on <display_name>.` Stop. Do not open\n"
"   the record or call any other tool.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"在固定记录的讨论区中添加简短内部备注。作为 `/reply` 的快捷补充，无编辑窗口、无收件人、无需审阅，用于用户明确要求为团队记录简短备注时。\n"
"\n"
"1. 从 `<ui_ctx>` 获取目标记录（模型 + id）；从记录启动的会话也可使用 `<linked_record>`。两者均未指定记录时，调用一次 `ask_user` 询问。\n"
"2. 将用户 `/log ...` 后的原文作为备注，不改写、不扩充、不润色；需要润色时应使用 `/reply`。用户未提供正文时，调用一次 `ask_user` 询问要记录什么。\n"
"3. 调用 `call_method`：\n"
"   - `model`：目标模型\n"
"   - `method`：`message_post`\n"
"   - `ids`：`[<id>]`\n"
"   - `kwargs`：\n"
"     - `body`：用户原文，使用纯文本。`message_post` 会转义字符串，HTML 标签将作为文字显示。\n"
"     - `subtype_xmlid`：`mail.mt_note`\n"
"     - `message_type`：`comment`\n"
"4. 用一句话确认，例如“已在 <display_name> 添加备注。”然后停止，不再打开记录或调用其他工具。\n"

#. module: muk_ai_skills
#: model:muk_ai.skill,body:muk_ai_skills.demo_skill_escalate
msgid ""
"\n"
"Schedule a `mail.activity` on the pinned record. Use when the user wants to create a follow-up\n"
"todo, call, meeting, or email reminder tied to a record.\n"
"\n"
"1. Take the target record (model + id) from `<ui_ctx>`, or from `<linked_record>` when the\n"
"   session was started from a record. If neither names one, call `ask_user` once for a\n"
"   record reference.\n"
"2. Collect the activity details. If the user already gave them in their request, use those; for\n"
"   anything still missing, call `ask_user` ONCE with a single combined question covering the\n"
"   missing pieces (type, deadline, assignee, summary). Acceptable activity types:\n"
"   - To-Do    → `mail.mail_activity_data_todo`\n"
"   - Call     → `mail.mail_activity_data_call`\n"
"   - Meeting  → `mail.mail_activity_data_meeting`\n"
"   - Email    → `mail.mail_activity_data_email`\n"
"   Defaults if unspecified after asking once: type = To-Do, deadline = today + 3 days, assignee\n"
"   = current user (omit `user_id`), summary = short echo of the user's request.\n"
"3. Resolve the assignee: if a name was given, `search_read` `res.users` with\n"
"   `[('name','ilike',<name>)]` (fall back to `login`), limit 5. Pick the unique match; if more\n"
"   than one, call `ask_user` once with the candidate list.\n"
"4. Call `call_method`:\n"
"   - `model`: target model\n"
"   - `method`: `activity_schedule`\n"
"   - `ids`: `[<id>]`\n"
"   - `kwargs`:\n"
"     - `act_type_xmlid`: chosen xmlid\n"
"     - `date_deadline`: ISO date string `YYYY-MM-DD`\n"
"     - `summary`: short title\n"
"     - `user_id`: assignee id (omit to default to current user)\n"
"     - `note`: optional HTML, only if the user provided extra context\n"
"5. Reply with one short confirmation: `Scheduled <type> on <display_name> for <date>, assigned\n"
"   to <assignee>.` Stop. Do not open the record afterwards.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"在固定记录上安排 `mail.activity`。用于用户希望添加与记录相关的待办、电话、会议或邮件提醒时。\n"
"\n"
"1. 从 `<ui_ctx>` 获取目标记录（模型 + id）；从记录启动的会话也可使用 `<linked_record>`。两者均未指定记录时，调用一次 `ask_user` 询问。\n"
"2. 收集活动详情，优先使用用户已提供的信息。仍有缺失时，只调用一次 `ask_user`，用一个问题同时询问缺失的类型、截止日期、负责人和摘要。允许的类型：\n"
"   - 待办 → `mail.mail_activity_data_todo`\n"
"   - 电话 → `mail.mail_activity_data_call`\n"
"   - 会议 → `mail.mail_activity_data_meeting`\n"
"   - 邮件 → `mail.mail_activity_data_email`\n"
"   询问一次后仍未指定的内容采用默认值：类型为待办，截止日期为今天 + 3 天，负责人为当前用户（省略 `user_id`），摘要为用户要求的简短概括。\n"
"3. 确定负责人：如提供了姓名，使用 `search_read` 搜索 `res.users`，域 `[('name','ilike',<name>)]`，不匹配时再按 `login` 搜索，限制 5 条。只有一个匹配时采用；多个匹配时调用一次 `ask_user` 并提供候选名单。\n"
"4. 调用 `call_method`：\n"
"   - `model`：目标模型\n"
"   - `method`：`activity_schedule`\n"
"   - `ids`：`[<id>]`\n"
"   - `kwargs`：\n"
"     - `act_type_xmlid`：所选 xmlid\n"
"     - `date_deadline`：ISO 日期字符串 `YYYY-MM-DD`\n"
"     - `summary`：简短标题\n"
"     - `user_id`：负责人 id（省略时为当前用户）\n"
"     - `note`：可选 HTML，仅在用户提供了额外信息时使用\n"
"5. 用一句话确认：“已在 <display_name> 安排 <type>，日期为 <date>，负责人为 <assignee>。”然后停止，不再打开记录。\n"

